# data/ is ignored because it holds the multi-MB corpus (devices.db, *.csv).
# These xref files are the opposite: ~25 KB of reference data that chipset_map.py
# REQUIRES. Without them the part<->marketing bridge is empty, and MediaTek — whose
# advisories are part-number-only while its spec strings are marketing-only — cannot
# be joined to a CVE at all. A fresh clone must get them.
!data/mt_wiki_xref.json
!data/qc_wiki_xref.json
!data/gsm_xref.json
!data/cpufetch_map.json
!data/mt_parts.json
